From c50484b6cccc9b78a09226973340e316e3c0cedf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: svend-blip <svend@torplarsen.dk>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 10:55:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] fix(moe): the routing log is a device-to-host copy, so
 the graph replays it

A pinned-to-pinned copy_ is a CPU memcpy at capture time, not a graph node;
the log held the capture step's ids for every later step.
---
 python/freetoken/moe/cpu_executor.py | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/python/freetoken/moe/cpu_executor.py b/python/freetoken/moe/cpu_executor.py
